application  choupoSolve;

//  AUDIENCE.  A SHOWCASE composes engineering (bin/curate/check_case_tiers):
//  a drug-product plant -- solvent spray drying in a closed nitrogen loop with
//  its solvent recovery, dry granulation, tableting and film coating -- is not
//  one feature being isolated, it is the base case a pharmaceutical project
//  group starts from (DEV.md 4c C97, phase A).
tier         showcase;
description  "APALUTAMIDE 60 mg FILM-COATED TABLETS, a drug-product plant (the API is BOUGHT), a generic entrant at loss of exclusivity, on a SOURCED design basis (docs/design/apalutamide-design-basis-dossier.md): the originator's patent formula (US 12,303,493 B2: a 1:3 apalutamide:HPMCAS-LG dispersion, a 700 mg core, a 3 % Opadry II coat), the dispersion spray-dried from 5 wt % acetone (the patent's acetone example) through a pressure nozzle in a closed nitrogen loop (blower, heater, spray dryer, exhaust cooler, -10 C solvent condenser, purge and N2 make-up), the recovered acetone to a tank for QC; dry granulation (blending, roller compaction, milling, a screen with a fines recycle), final blend, tableting with rejects, film coating (an aqueous coat sprayed on and its water dried off by hot air) and packaging. The steady flowsheet is the material balance per unit of product (15 625 tablets/h pressed, the patent's PSD-3 dryer at 75 kg/h of solution, is a basis); a BATCH PLAN (system/postDict) sizes each step for a 400 kg lot, counts 25 lots a year for 14.0 million tablets (25 % of the estimated European market), and finds the pace of each train -- the spray dryer on round-the-clock campaigns, the solid-dose suite lot by lot on two shifts. Blending, compaction, milling, screening, tableting and packaging are MASS-BALANCE PLACEHOLDERS (no equipment physics). Every number the dossier could not source is an author-set assumption, said so where it is declared (README).";
verbosity    2;

reports
{
    streamTable   {}
    massBalance   {}
    energyBalance {}
    computed      {}
    spreadsheet   {}
}

